OL,3,GNEWSALondon Underground hit by driver
OL,4,Astrike but more trains running than
OL,5,Aexpected
OL,6,
OL,7,FServices are operating better than
OL,8,Fexpected because more drivers than
OL,9,Fpredicted have turned up for work, TfL
OL,10,Fsays
OL,12,FLondon's Mayor Sadiq Khan is urging TfL
OL,13,Fand RMT to resolve their dispute, with
OL,14,Fhis spokesperson saying "nobody wants
OL,15,Fto see strike action"
OL,17,FThe disagreement centres around the
OL,18,Fproposed voluntary introduction of a
OL,19,Ffour-day working week with condensed
OL,20,Fhours. Read more about why drivers are
OL,21,Fstriking
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
